Package: plank-client
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: PLANK Engineering <engineering@instinctual.la>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: bash, libdecor-0-plugin-1-cairo, udev, @DEPENDS@
Recommends: intel-media-va-driver-non-free
Description: PLANK remote workstation client (Ubuntu 24.04)
 Dedicated client for authenticated PLANK sessions on Ubuntu 24.04.
 The package carries its qualified Qt 6.10.2, SDL3, and FFmpeg 9 runtime
 privately and leaves the Ubuntu system FFmpeg installation unchanged.
 Software decode remains available when Intel VA-API is not installed.
